sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as Web App
    participant API
    participant DB as Database
    User->>App: Open dashboard
    App->>API: GET /me
    activate API
    API->>DB: SELECT user
    DB-->>API: user row
    API-->>App: 200 OK
    deactivate API
    alt Session expired
        App->>User: Redirect to login
    else Session valid
        App->>User: Render dashboard
    end
    Note over App,API: Responses are cached for 60s
    loop Every 30s
        App->>API: Heartbeat
    end
